{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_blkngt_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_blkngt_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"荒地生灵","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blkngt_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"caadc208b497fdc37bd2bdef2a54653cd250e4fe770b23275ffeed0f5514d340","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"夜半在罗德岛本舰过上了难得的安逸生活，但她仍然怀念着从前在荒地上的日子。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"桑葚小姐，作为夜半小姐的引导人，这件事你怎么看呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博、博士，我想，按夜半小姐说一不二的个性，应该刚递交完申请书就离开这里了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你听起来好像有些埋怨她。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以，你同意她离去吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不过我的想法也没那么重要，博士，我想问问您的意见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"算了，既然她已经离开，我们再讨论也没有什么必要。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉博士您好像也不太开心的样子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没有，你多想了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"嗯咳，你多虑了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你知道她为什么选择离开吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不过，我很好奇她离开的原因。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也不知道原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我本来以为她早已适应了这里的生活，虽然我初次见她的时候，她确实显得不太自在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时她的病情不太稳定，所以应医疗部的建议，决定驻舰成为正式干员，以便他们随时观察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我被任命为她的引导人，带她熟悉舰内大小事宜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......你就是我在这艘船上的队长？看你这小胳膊小腿，你能保护我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜、夜半小姐，我的体能虽然比不上你，但如果遇到危险，我也会倾尽所能保护你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，挺有自信嘛，看你表现好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以后我和你就住在这屋子里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然夜半小姐你的病情还没有严重到要住进医疗部的程度，但也是需要时刻关注的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间，为了方便监测你的健康状况，我会与你同住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的窗户打不开吗？我想吹吹风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得温度太高了？我这就把空调打开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在感觉怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......感觉有点不对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜半小姐，你是不太舒服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许吧，可能是我身体的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，那个，冒犯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你要做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉你额头的温度很正常......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会儿吃完晚饭我们可以去医疗部做一个更为细致的检查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我看应该没什么问题，医疗部就不用去了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定吗？你看起来不太舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，差点忘了把这个给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"护身符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道这是护身符，但是这一串也太多了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......多的话，会更加灵验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先说好，我是不会把这一堆东西挂在身上到处跑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用带出去，挂在柜子里也可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了吧，香火味太浓了，衣服会变得难闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起，是我考虑不周！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，我就说了，和你们这样的娇娇女打交道是真的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呜，好难相处啊......不行，再怎么说，这也是我的任务，得努力和她处好关系才行。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你想去哪里看看吗？我带你去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，你站住，不要跟着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有可是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜半小姐，等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很长一段时间里，我以为是夜半小姐她性格如此，不愿意和人亲近，再加上初来乍到，有些拘谨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在看来，她只是不喜欢这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但当时她并没有直接离开。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可她为什么现在才选择离开？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上个月，我们的外出救援任务结束，从荒地回到了舰船上。不久后她就向我提出要辞去正式干员的职位，恢复合作干员的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，或许是荒地上发生的一些事情让她对这里产生了不满。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或许......问题出在我身上，是我让她无法忍受继续留在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"别乱想，这纯属无稽之谈。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"相信我，夜半小姐绝不会这样想。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您......博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"介意将你们在荒地上的经历讲给我听听吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，这也是让我一直百思不得其解的地方，因为在我看来，这段经历并没有什么让人烦恼的地方。相反，我觉得它很有趣，也很愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为，经过这次外勤任务，我和夜半小姐亲近了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至说，我觉得她已经融入了我们的生活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先说好，这次到外面你要听我的，不许拖我后腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我是队长啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比我能打吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在荒地上生活的时间比我久吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我为什么要听你的命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗嗤，哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜半小姐你......为什么突然笑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，看你这呆头呆脑的样子，觉得有些好玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚的话......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是逗你玩的。明明任务都快要结束了，你还一副紧张兮兮的样子，天天拘在帐篷里面，我这次非得把你拉到外面逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还以为那些话是我的真心话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实话说，我之前确实这么认为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来不是错觉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那都是我的偏见，不是吗？和你相处这么久，你所做的点点滴滴都已经足够向我证明，你非常优秀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么突然就开始夸我，多、多不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么不好意思？做得好就应该被大家赞扬。我还记得那位老人家，谁都觉得没戏，但你居然真想到法子把她救出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有大家的帮忙，我也做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少和我扯这些，夸你厉害就是因为你厉害，不许怀疑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，接着，尝尝吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，你怎么这么近都接不到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，你吃另外一个吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你不要捡那个果子了，掉在地上不卫生，吃了要肚子痛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事多，就破了点皮，怎么就不能吃了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹拿袖子擦擦呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好、好吃，我从来没有吃过这种果子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一次，我和同伴行进的路线上有一片靠近河流的树林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林子里长着很多这样的果子，离开的时候我们每个人都摘了一堆，身上的口袋都塞满了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来就再没碰见过了，没想到这里居然长了这么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以多摘一些带回去，让大家都尝尝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天带你出来可不是为了摘果子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我、我不知道这个......夜半小姐，你还有其他什么事吗？我以为我们就是来外面走走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你紧张什么？跟我来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你、你别拉我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，小点声儿，洞穴里藏着一只大家伙，别吓到它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你为什么要带我来这里？太危险了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（危险？有我在，你很安全好吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（专业老师曾经讲过，野外工作需要我们尽可能避开野生动物的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打住，打住，谁管你的老师怎么说，注意看，它要出来了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"细微的响动从洞穴中传来，桑葚眯起眼睛，想要看个仔细。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但过了半天，声音沉寂下去，只有洞穴前方的灌木在被风吹过后，发出沙沙的响动。\n就在她快要失去耐性，想要叫旁边那个人一起回营地时，一只野兽从洞穴中探出头来。\n它肌肉结实，皮毛光滑，张着嘴，粗壮的獠牙清晰可见，可以轻松咬断猎物的喉管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好、好大一只......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我、我有点害怕，夜半，我们，那个......回去吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（放心，这个距离它发现不了我们。你这么着急地爬起来，反而会让它注意到这里。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可、可是我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（别着急离开，再等一下。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"野兽凶猛的样子让桑葚不由得把半张脸埋进双臂间，只露出一双眼睛，偷偷打量着它在洞穴口抽动鼻子的样子。\n似乎是确定周围没有危险，那只野兽松懈下来，从咽喉里滚出几声嚎叫，像是在呼唤着什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"很快，一只小兽步履蹒跚，晃晃悠悠地从洞穴中走出。\n或许是因为泥土湿滑，它还没走几步就狠狠跌了一跤，脑袋撞上了野兽的后腿。\n野兽丝毫不恼，只是回过头轻轻舔舐它的脑袋，鼓励它再次站起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（加油，你一定可以的，小宝宝。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哇哇哇，它做到了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好、好可爱啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我之前来这里寻找食物的时候发现了怀孕的它，算算日子，我估计它的孩子应该诞生了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真好，和妈妈在一起，它什么都不用怕。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看，它们要离开了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（它们要去哪里？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（它们得趁秋天的时候吃得饱饱的，这样才好度过漫长寒冷的冬天。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，别看了，它们都跑得不见影儿了，我们也该回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没见过这样的场景，从来没有。啊不，其实在纪录片里面看到过，但是那样不算数的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有亲眼见到的这么震撼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"震撼？很稀松平常的事情啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜半小姐以前生活的地方一定常常能看到这样美好的场景，所以才会说出这样的话来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说的对，总能看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要记得写下来呀，夜半小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？记得什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得写进发往本舰的报告里，这可是很特殊的见闻呢，很值得一提。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道了，会写的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许拖到最后一天才写哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，快走吧，我带你去摘那些果子，营地里的大家应该都想尝尝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是那句话触怒了夜半小姐吧，怪我不会看气氛，讲出那么扫兴的话。按她的个性，一定对那些条条框框很抵触。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，博士，怎么办？现在夜半小姐已经离开，我才后知后觉地反应过来，想道歉也没有机会了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这不是你的错，不必介怀。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我想，你其实遗憾的不是没有道歉，而是没有道别吧。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是或者不是，现在谈什么都晚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你俩在这里嘀嘀咕咕什么呢？哎，博士，我的申请书批下来了没有？递上去好多天了，怎么一点儿动静都没有？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们正在讨论。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你应该先敲门。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，婆婆妈妈的，麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜半小姐，呜......我以为你已经离开了，我还想，都没和你告别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不是你们规定了离开前必须提交报告，然后等待批准吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......主要是，你不是很厌恶这些规定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待了这么久，我清楚，你们的规定自有你们的道理，虽然不喜欢，但也不是不能适应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再者......这里有朋友，不能不告而别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你必须离开的理由是什么呢，夜半小姐。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你为什么不愿意留在这里呢？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，夜半小姐，如果你有哪里不适应，尽可以提出来，我们都会帮助你解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这里的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是因为这里，难道是因为这里的人吗？你、你是不是因为讨厌我，才、才不愿意留下的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有这么想过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不讨厌我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你人很好，工作负责，业务能力也强。我直到现在才离开，就是因为你需要我帮忙，不然我早就走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你帮忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，你还记不记得那天？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，夜半小姐，你怎么来了，是身体不舒服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，劳烦问下，桑葚在里面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"对，你......是在等她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说她的任务结束了，昨天就回舰了，但是直到现在我都没有看到她，怎么，她受伤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"没有没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这次救援任务带回来的患者数目远超估计，医疗部的人手紧缺，所以暂时借调桑葚小姐来这里为一些轻症病人做应急治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不太好吧？她可是刚刚出完外勤任务回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"她执意留下，本来她应该第二天再来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很担心她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么一脸不可思议的表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"没，只是桑葚小姐提起你的时候总是唉声叹气，她好像觉得你并不喜欢和她相处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我从来没这么说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，大家都希望你能多帮帮她呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮她，为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"桑葚小姐的专业能力值得信赖，但是年纪还小，在荒地上的生存经验尚且不足，有你在，正好带她学些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那现在她的工作结束了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"应该早就结束了啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......大叔、你受伤......别乱动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，桑葚小姐居然就这么靠着衣柜门睡着了，一定是累坏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她念叨什么呢？睡都睡不踏实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小帽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小帽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让那家伙睡得更深些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小帽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，帮个忙可以吗？让这家伙趴到我背上，睡在这里可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，哦哦，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，光会给我找麻烦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来那天把我送回宿舍的人是夜半小姐你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？那天你能睡得那么香，可是多亏了小帽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我误会了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是爱多想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我想，或许误会产生的原因不仅仅是多想。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可夜半小姐你的讲话方式也很容易让人误会啊。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我之前相处的人里，没有你这样的女孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是故意想让你难过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，既然、既然误会澄清了，夜半小姐，请你留下吧！我在这里学到了很多，一定可以帮助你稳定病情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......还是想回到荒地上，那里的生活对我来说，更加惬意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这不是问题，有很多外勤任务都需要干员外出。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你可以专门负责荒地上的外勤任务。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不一样，还是不一样。我知道，在这里我能衣食无忧，还有药物可以控制我的病情。我认识了新的同伴，学会了新的技能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人应该知足的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可有些时候，晚上醒来，盯着白花花的天花板，没有月亮，没有星星，没有虫鸣，心里还是空落落的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的直觉告诉我，我的内心呼唤我，我的念头折磨我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只不过是很简单的一句话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要活在一抬头就能看到天空的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道......你身体的状况有多糟糕吗，夜半小姐？那片天空它要如何保护你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意！你的申请我不批准！博士，请您也不要批准夜半小姐的申请书！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑葚，听我说，我知道我的选择不多，所以我才要认认真真，选出自己最想要的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得我带你去看的那只野兽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......一直记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒地上，那样的野兽有很多，很多很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年前，我还遇到过一只眠兽。那是个强壮的孩子，看到它第一眼，我就下定决心要将它驯服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我几次尝试靠近与交流，都被它拒绝。它一旦见到我，立刻就逃得无影无踪。好吃的食物，绵软的暖窝，它都无动于衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次意外，它被自己的猎物伤害，我将它救下，带回营地治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随着它的伤势逐渐好转，它对我从一开始的警惕满满，变为后来的亲昵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为自己已将它驯服，不再时时刻刻都盯着它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在一次简短的狩猎过后，我回到营地，它已经不在了，只留下我给它织的一顶小帽子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很生气，荒地上毛线并不好搞到手......我以为它很喜欢这顶帽子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是顺着它的足迹，我跟了上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我找到它时，看见它在一片沙地中打滚，滚得脏兮兮的。但它非常快乐，是我见过的最快乐的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我便转身离开了，那一刻我深知，它不属于我，它属于那片沙地，属于那片广阔的沙漠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......好了","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我明白了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"夜半小姐，你的辞行申请我批准了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"从此以后你的身份恢复为罗德岛的合作干员，不必再驻舰了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果非要离开......至少、至少你离开前，记得带足药。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"半年后"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点啊，快点接通啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？有人在听吗？我是干员桑葚，在前往龙门的任务途中遭遇特大沙暴，请求紧急支援！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人吗？有人在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的没办法了吗？怎么办，难道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我会死在这里吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好饿，好困，好难受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人会来吧......根本没人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......爸爸......妈妈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......我真的......坚持不住了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啾——啾——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（谁......是谁在舔我？呜，好痒......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醒了就赶紧把眼睛睁开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看不清，声音好熟悉......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在那里眯着眼睛干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原来是被沙子迷住眼睛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眨眨眼看看，好了没？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，没了我，你可怎么办呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎哎，你干嘛抱那么紧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快松开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑葚","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我好想你啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了......算了，就一小会儿，我容许你再抱一小会儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]}]}
